# Log in first with http/auth.http, then run this in the same VS Code session.

### Dashboard (S04)
# Expect 200 { summary: { totalProducts, totalUnits, lowCount, outCount, movementsToday },
#   restock: { items: up to 5, total }, recentActivity: up to 5 }.
# Figures cover only the warehouses of the caller; "today" is the WIB calendar day.
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard
